    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Undead: Rise of the Betrayed King - is an exhilarating role-playing game where you take to the skies in the form of a mighty dragon, the last guardian of balance in the world. Awakened evil threatens to destroy everything in its path, and only you, possessing the ability to transform into a human, can stand against this malevolence.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs a dragon, you employ your unique abilities to explore grand landscapes, unravel the secrets, and combat curses cast by the awakened evil. When the hour of battle arrives, you transform into a powerful warrior, utilizing ancient spells and magical artifacts.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUndead: Rise of the Betrayed King not only offers an epic adventure but also presents moral dilemmas that impact the storyline. Choose wisely, for your decisions determine not only your fate but also the fate of the entire world. Exciting quests, captivating battles, and astonishing discoveries await you in this world of magic and peril.",
    "about_the_game": "Undead: Rise of the Betrayed King - is an exhilarating role-playing game where you take to the skies in the form of a mighty dragon, the last guardian of balance in the world. Awakened evil threatens to destroy everything in its path, and only you, possessing the ability to transform into a human, can stand against this malevolence.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs a dragon, you employ your unique abilities to explore grand landscapes, unravel the secrets, and combat curses cast by the awakened evil. When the hour of battle arrives, you transform into a powerful warrior, utilizing ancient spells and magical artifacts.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUndead: Rise of the Betrayed King not only offers an epic adventure but also presents moral dilemmas that impact the storyline. Choose wisely, for your decisions determine not only your fate but also the fate of the entire world. Exciting quests, captivating battles, and astonishing discoveries await you in this world of magic and peril.",
    "short_description": "In Undead: Rise of the Betrayed King Demo, you will play as the elven warrior Mirim, one of our the companions. Explore the Forbidden Forest and the Necromancer\u2019s Crypt. Level up your character and find new weapons to defeat the necromancer.",
